      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Systembrief — gesamter Creation Process\n\n**Ein** Workflow für Stoff → Video → privat → Release.\n\n`mode`: ingest | produce | release | status | full\n\nWebhook `POST /webhook/systembrief`\n```json\n{ \"mode\": \"full\", \"slug\": \"mein-thema\", \"privacy\": \"private\" }\n```\n\nContent-Gate vor jedem Build. YouTube-Quota stoppt die Site nicht.\nRelease nur über mode=release / 09:00-Cron — nie implizit public.\n\nEnv: `SYSTEMBRIEF_PIPELINE_ROOT`, optional Token/Notify/Secret.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
